#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:4
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "键盘快捷键"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:10
msgid "Configuring Shortcuts"
msgstr "配置快捷键"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:12
msgid "|configure_shortcuts_window|"
msgstr "|配置快捷键窗口|"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:14
msgid ""
"Predefined shortcuts are available for OpenToonz tools, modifiers and "
"menu commands. They can be customized, and new shortcuts can be added "
"for undefined items."
msgstr ""
"OpenToonz工具、修改器和菜单命令都有预定义的快捷方式。它们可以自定义，也可"
"以为未定义的项目添加新的快捷方式。"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:16
msgid ""
"Shortcuts are specific to each user, meaning that each user in the "
"system can have a different set of shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"快捷方式是特定于每个用户的，这意味着系统中的每个用户都可以有一组不同的快"
"捷方式。"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:18
msgid "**To configure a shortcut:**"
msgstr "**要配置快捷方式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:20
#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:30
msgid "Choose File  →  **Configure Shortcuts...**"
msgstr "选择文件→  **配置快捷方式。..**"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:22
#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:32
msgid ""
"Search for the command or tool you want to configure the shortcut for in "
"the appropriate folder, or by using the Search field at the top of the "
"window."
msgstr ""
"在相应的文件夹中搜索要配置快捷方式的命令或工具，或使用窗口顶部的“搜索”字"
"段。"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:24
#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:34
msgid "Select the command or tool name in the list."
msgstr "在列表中选择命令或工具名称。"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:26
msgid ""
"Press the keyboard key, or combination of keys, you want to assign as "
"shortcut."
msgstr "按要指定为快捷键的键盘键或组合键。"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:28
msgid "**To remove a configured shortcut:**"
msgstr "**要删除已配置的快捷方式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/keyboard_shortcuts.rst:36
msgid "Click the Remove button."
msgstr "点击删除按钮"

